00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:34.350
Looking at the problem, it says,
18.7 divided by 1.38 plus 5.1.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:39.720
The key is whenever you see fractions,
the first thing I would always

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.330
