00:02:54.975 --> 00:03:00.975
What I always like to do for myself is
assume that these are always both in

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:06.645
parentheses, so that means you carry out
the operations on top and the operations

00:03:06.645 --> 00:03:12.345
on bottom before proceeding to do the
fraction, because whenever you have a

00:03:12.345 --> 00:03:16.200
