00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:45.210
gonna see you will get 6.48.

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:47.700
Now we do the next step.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.800
So we did addition, we
did parentheses first.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:53.160
Now we have division
between top and bottom.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:04:03.480
We will carry out the 18.7
