00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:30.330
So they stayed.

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.090
And then we also have seconds.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:37.590
So this thing is going to be
centimeters, kilograms, all over seconds.

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:42.000
It's this big derived unit
that we are making here.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.740
So centimeters times.

00:19:44.535 --> 00:19:46.215
Kilograms all over seconds.

00:19:47.325 --> 00:19:50.745
Now, being that we said that we're going
to be rounding this to three sig figs,

00:19:51.045 --> 00:19:52.305
so we're gonna round it right here.

00:19:53.265 --> 00:20:01.935
This is going to equal 9.94 centimeters
times kilograms divided by seconds.

